  "answer_text": "Great news! Apple's current flagship iPhone lineup includes the **iPhone 17e** (2026), **iPhone 17**, **iPhone 17 Pro**, **iPhone 17 Pro Max**, and **iPhone Air**. Here's where you can buy them:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Where to Buy the Latest iPhone\n\n1. **Apple (apple.com or Apple Store)**\n   The best place to start is directly from Apple. You can choose two-hour delivery from an Apple Store, free delivery, or easy pickup options. When you buy directly from Apple, you'll get access to Personal Setup \u2014 guided online sessions where a Specialist can walk you through setup and data transfer, or focus on features that help you make the most of your iPhone. You can also trade in your current iPhone or Android device and apply any credit toward your purchase.\n\n2. **Best Buy (bestbuy.com)**\n   Shop Best Buy for the latest Apple iPhone and accessories, including the newest iPhone models. You can also look for trade-in discounts as well as offers made by coverage plans, and consider an unlocked iPhone for cellular plan flexibility or open-box products for discounted prices.\n\n3. **T-Mobile (t-mobile.com)**\n   T-Mobile carries the full lineup, including the iPhone 17 Pro Max, iPhone 17 Pro, iPhone 17e, iPhone Air, and iPhone 17.\n\n4. **Other Carriers** (AT&T, Verizon, etc.)\n   Most major wireless carriers sell the latest iPhones, often with promotional deals and financing options.\n\n5. **Amazon**\n   Amazon is also a great option, especially for refurbished or older models at discounted prices. For example, a renewed 128GB iPhone 14 Pro from Amazon will set you back $439.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Quick Tips\n- The iPhone 17e is Apple's most affordable current option at **$599**, offering the A19 chip, 256GB of base storage, MagSafe charging, and a 48MP Fusion camera.\n- If budget is not a concern and you want the absolute best, the **iPhone 17 Pro Max** ships with the A19 Pro chip and a 6.9-inch ProMotion OLED display.\n- Apple is also working on new **iPhone 18** models expected to come out in the fall of 2026, so if you're not in a rush, it may be worth waiting!",
